                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "10 degrees",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "bold"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ". If the sea is rough, we cancel by 6 am and say so on the "
                        },
